This folder contains my SQL learning progress as part of my Data Science.
I created this folder to practise SQL concepts step by step.

# What This Folder Contains

- Basic SQL queries (SELECT, WHERE, ORDER BY)
- Filtering and sorting data
- Aggregate functions like COUNT, SUM, AVG, MIN, MAX
- GROUP BY and HAVING clauses
- Joins (INNER JOIN, LEFT JOIN, RIGHT JOIN)
- Subqueries and simple CTEs
- Basic data modification queries (INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE)
